  "scenes": [
    {
      "id": "hook",
      "file": "audio/taiwan-youth-no-kids/01-hook.wav",
      "sec": 3.896,
      "text": "台灣年輕人為什麼不生，是不敢生，還是不想生？",
      "hash": "260394d9703f",
      "voice": "Sulafat",
      "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts"
    },
    {
      "id": "what-is-tfr",
      "file": "audio/taiwan-youth-no-kids/02-what-is-tfr.wav",
      "sec": 4.056,
      "text": "總生育率的意思是，一位女性一生平均生幾個小孩。",
      "hash": "6ae40097f971",
      "voice": "Sulafat",
      "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts"
    },
    {
      "id": "tfr-record-low",
      "file": "audio/taiwan-youth-no-kids/03-tfr-record-low.wav",
      "sec": 4.21,
      "text": "去年總生育率只剩零點六九五，跌到有統計以來最低。",
      "hash": "1cc72996f548",
      "voice": "Sulafat",
      "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts"
    },
    {
      "id": "births-2026",
      "file": "audio/taiwan-youth-no-kids/04-births-2026.wav",
      "sec": 4.71,
      "text": "今年前九個月新生兒不到七萬，國發會估全年會跌破十萬。",
      "hash": "93bcded4e614",
      "voice": "Sulafat",
      "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts"
    },
    {
      "id": "top-reasons",
      "file": "audio/taiwan-youth-no-kids/05-top-reasons.wav",
      "sec": 4.581,
      "text": "衛福部調查，不想生主因是錢，其次是不想改變生活。",
      "hash": "f7682190b31e",
      "voice": "Sulafat",
      "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts"
    },
    {
      "id": "wage-vs-housing",
      "file": "audio/taiwan-youth-no-kids/06-wage-vs-housing.wav",
      "sec": 4.929,
      "text": "青年月薪中位數三萬二，房價卻要全家不吃不喝近十年。",
      "hash": "1890fb81f64e",
      "voice": "Sulafat",
      "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts"
    },
    {
      "id": "working-hours",
      "file": "audio/taiwan-youth-no-kids/07-working-hours.wav",
      "sec": 4.576,
      "text": "上班族一年工作兩千零三十小時，比南韓、日本都多。",
      "hash": "d59909be2029",
      "voice": "Sulafat",
      "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts"
    },
    {
      "id": "childcare-gap",
      "file": "audio/taiwan-youth-no-kids/08-childcare-gap.wav",
      "sec": 5.833,
      "text": "聯合報盤點，公托只夠百分之四點九的幼兒，一百六十四個鄉鎮區完全沒有。",
      "hash": "7beb1b5b1b66",
      "voice": "Sulafat",
      "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts"
    },
    {
      "id": "marriage-bound",
      "file": "audio/taiwan-youth-no-kids/09-marriage-bound.wav",
      "sec": 4.827,
      "text": "台灣非婚生育只有百分之二到四，所以不結婚，幾乎就等於不生。",
      "hash": "ad78f7402acc",
      "voice": "Sulafat",
      "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts"
    },
    {
      "id": "unmarried-trend",
      "file": "audio/taiwan-youth-no-kids/10-unmarried-trend.wav",
      "sec": 4.933,
      "text": "有學者認為關鍵是不婚，三十五到三十九歲未婚比例超過四成。",
      "hash": "2fa41d76a2b5",
      "voice": "Sulafat",
      "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts"
    },
    {
      "id": "policy-spending",
      "file": "audio/taiwan-youth-no-kids/11-policy-spending.wav",
      "sec": 5.334,
      "text": "少子化預算八年編了五千八百三十九億，總生育率卻還在往下掉。",
      "hash": "3a12894291c2",
      "voice": "Sulafat",
      "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts"
    },
    {
      "id": "two-cash-plans",
      "file": "audio/taiwan-youth-no-kids/12-two-cash-plans.wav",
      "sec": 4.708,
      "text": "朝野都主張發錢給零到十八歲，但兩版怎麼整合，還沒定案。",
      "hash": "f27d8b33701a",
      "voice": "Sulafat",
      "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts"
    },
    {
      "id": "youth-voices",
      "file": "audio/taiwan-youth-no-kids/13-youth-voices.wav",
      "sec": 4.464,
      "text": "年輕人怎麼說？有人不敢生，有人不想生，理由都很真實。",
      "hash": "d41428bdf958",
      "voice": "Sulafat",
      "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts"
    },
    {
      "id": "summary",
      "file": "audio/taiwan-youth-no-kids/14-summary.wav",
      "sec": 5.916,
      "text": "總結：不敢生是錢、房和時間，不想生是選擇，兩者都在增加。",
      "hash": "b894d51bca78",
      "voice": "Sulafat",
      "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts"
    },
    {
      "id": "end",
      "file": "audio/taiwan-youth-no-kids/15-end.wav",
      "sec": 2.124,
      "text": "白話國際，一支講透一件事。",
      "hash": "d4c09ecda483",
      "voice": "Sulafat",
      "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts"
    }
  ]
}